# Overwinter - the old hut across the bay, closed up in 1961 with its stove
# and bunks left in "against need". "A stove going, a lamp, two bunks, four
# crates with the station's stencil on them." No figures are drawn.
# Provisional art (RFC 0025): see stills.json.
